  "limitations": [
    "Custom contact layers share a render-clock receipt. Network/frame scheduling can delay presentation; the native audit records the maximum observed delay. Vanilla hurt-red/velocity and authoritative damage keep their engine timing and were not retimed.",
    "This is the existing player-style visual terrain displacement, not persistent removal or deformation of world blocks.",
    "Only verified Hunter/Juggernaut ground contacts are connected so far; other creatures still require individual contact calibration.",
